  "title": "Chef John&#39;s Kofta Kebabs",
  "description": "These grilled kofta kebab skewers are made with a delicious savory mixture of ground beef, lamb, herbs, and Middle Eastern spices for tons of flavor.",
  "authors": [
    "John Mitzewich"
  ],
  "date_published": "2022-06-08T17:31:09-04:00",
