    "description": "In this video, Chef John shares his recipe for kofta kabobs, a Mediterranean-style meatball on a stick. He starts by toasting a piece of whole grain bread and dicing it along with onions, parsley, and garlic. The mixture is finely chopped and combined with a blend of beef and lamb and seasoned with spices like allspice, paprika, and cayenne pepper. After chilling the mixture, roll the meat around bamboo skewers and grill them until well-cooked. The kabobs are served on a platter with a fresh salad and accompanied by tahini dressing and flatbread. They're tender, flavorful, and are a satisfying dinner option!",
